e for subject DN and SANs" }, { names: ["-own_trusted"], value: "required", description: "Optional certs to verify chain building for own CMP signer cert" }, { names: ["-key"], value: "required", description: "CMP signer private key, not used when -secret given" }, { names: ["-keypass"], value: "required", description: "Client private key (and cert and old cert) pass phrase source" }, { names: ["-digest"], value: "required", description: "Digest to use in message protection and POPO signatures" }, { names: ["-mac"], value: "required", description: "MAC algorithm to use in PBM-based message protection" }, { names: ["-extracerts"], value: "required", description: "Certificates to append in extraCerts field of outgoing messages" }, { names: ["-unprotected_requests"], description: "Send request messages without CMP-level protection" }, { names: ["-certform"], value: "required", description: "Format (PEM or DER) to use when saving a certificate to a file" }, { names: ["-crlform"], value: "required", description: "Format (PEM or DER) to use when saving a CRL to a file" }, { names: ["-keyform"], value: "required", description: "Format of the key input (ENGINE, other values ignored)" }, { names: ["-otherpass"], value: "required", description: "Pass phrase source potentially needed for loading certificates of others" }, { names: ["-engine"], value: "required", description: "Use crypto engine with given identifier, possibly a hardware device" }, { names: ["-provider-path"], value: "required", description: "Provider load path (must be before 'provider' argument if required)" }, { names: ["-provider"], value: "required", description: "Provider to load (can be specified multiple times)" }, { names: ["-provparam"], value: "required", description: "Set a provider key-value parameter" }, { names: ["-propquery"], value: "required", description: "Property query used when fetching algorithms" }, { names: ["-rand"], value: "required", description: "Load the given file(s) into the rando